sequenceDiagram
  actor Player
  participant UI as Control UI
  participant Native as Native peer owner
  participant Relay as Authorized relay
  participant Peer as Peer native owner

  Player->>UI: Check fresh sharing consent and create or join
  UI->>Native: Explicit action and consent
  Native->>Native: Validate relay and consent generation
  Native->>Relay: Request scoped membership
  Relay-->>Native: Admitted membership or rejection
  Native-->>UI: Membership state without credentials
  Note over Native,Relay: Non-null samples require room, match and team binding
  Note over Relay,Peer: Peer has independent consent and admitted membership

  loop Valid membership, one in-flight sync
    Peer->>Relay: Its admitted narrow own sample or null
    Native->>Native: Recheck ownership, scope, source age and sequence
    alt Own sample admitted and fresh
      Native->>Relay: Narrow own vitals
    else Source invalid, stale or unavailable
      Native->>Relay: Null sample, withdraw prior publication
    end
    Relay-->>Native: Authorized peer projection
    Native->>Native: Check scope, generation and accumulated age
    Native-->>UI: Current admitted vitals or stale/null
  end
  Note over UI,Peer: Peer vitals remain transient, no persistence, AI or history

  Player->>UI: Leave
  UI->>Native: Leave now
  Native->>Native: Increment generation, clear credentials and samples
  Native-->>UI: Idle with no peer vitals
  Native->>Relay: Best-effort membership removal
  opt Delayed join or sync completion
    Relay-->>Native: Reply for old generation
    Native->>Native: Discard, never reconnect or repopulate
    opt Late join created an orphan membership
      Native->>Relay: Best-effort orphan cleanup
    end
  end

